    The Serializable envelope format looks like::

        {
            "lc": 1,
            "type": "constructor",
            "id": ["langchain_core", "messages", "<ClassName>"],
            "kwargs": {...},
        }

    Chunk variants (e.g. `HumanMessageChunk`) are coerced to their parent
    message type.

    Args:
        message: a dict that may be a serialized message envelope.

    Returns:
        The reconstructed message, or `None` if the dict is not a full
        envelope (in which case the caller falls through to the existing
